shortdesc Chinese Introduction to TeX and LaTeX
longdesc The document is an introduction to TeX/LaTeX, in Chinese. It
longdesc covers basic text typesetting, mathematics, graphics, tables,
longdesc Chinese language & fonts, and some miscellaneous features
longdesc (hyperlinks, long documents, bibliographies, indexes and page
longdesc layout).
